# The ignore file of apps/won-discounts/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` next to the
# Dockerfile; the build context is the REPO ROOT). Secrets and local state never enter the image.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/shpat.md
**/.auth
**/.shopify
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/node_modules
**/build
**/target
**/dist/function.wasm
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.superpowers
.superpowers
docs
**/docs/evidence
**/tests/e2e
**/e2e
*.png
*.jpeg
*.jpg
